flowchart LR
    User --> Login[User Login]
    Login --> DjangoApp[Django Application]
    DjangoApp -- Creates Session --> Redis[Redis Session Store]
    DjangoApp -- Enforces --> Cookie[Cookie Flags]
    DjangoApp -- Tracks Activity --> Idle[Idle Timeout Middleware]
    DjangoApp -- Manages Policy --> Concurrent[Concurrent Login]

    Idle -- Triggers Warning or Invalidation --> User
    Concurrent -- Invalidates Other Sessions --> Redis
    Revoke[Session Revocation] -- Deletes Session Key --> Redis

    Redis -- Session Missing --> Invalid[Session Invalidated]
    Invalid --> User -- Requires Re-login --> Login